INFO - 2026-07-08 17:54:45,049 - social.agent - Agent 61 performed action: create_comment with args: {'post_id': 27, 'content': 'User 71 and 20 are speaking my language. I\'ve been driving these streets for years and I\'ve seen the same pattern — they start with one "pilot" and before you know it, the whole corridor\'s been choked down. My income depends on getting from pickup to dropoff fast. Every extra minute I\'m crawling adds up across a shift. That\'s less rides, less tips, and more angry passengers watching the meter tick. People who say "travel time barely changed" must not be doing this for a living.'}
